[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20800400_03_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20800400_03_0010","text":"啊———\nL'Antica———"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20800400_03_0020","text":"哈哈，被你发现了。\n是很大的广告牌吧？除了这里，其他城市也有哦。"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20800400_03_0030","text":"嗯……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20800400_03_0040","text":"L'Antica……在扩散……\n经过……好多好多地方……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20800400_03_0050","text":"是啊……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20800400_03_0060","text":"雾子之前不是说了吗，\n『我来开车送你』。"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20800400_03_0070","text":"我觉得，我就是这样被雾子和L'Antica的大家，\n带着去了好多好多地方。"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20800400_03_0071","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20800400_03_0080","text":"——所以，这样就足够了。"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20800400_03_0081","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20800400_03_0090","text":"那么……就这样……\n出发吧……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20800400_03_0100","text":"从这里……再往前一点……"}]
